  "body": "![MC PvZ Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/57ec702d452ff5f8b7e2058c0aa916605e4524b2.png)\n--------------------\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9i24vE4yeCE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n--------------------\n\n# This beta includes the first world of the game.\nThis is a recreation of the original \"Plants Vs. Zombies\" game inside of minecraft using the Utility Engine\n\n--------------------\n### has 10 levels including\n- bowling minigames\n- conveyor bosses\n- 8 plants\n- 5 zombies\n- almanac\n- custom naming\n- level select features\n- decompiled resource pack for easy modding\n\n--------------------\n\n## Credits\n### Team\n- Clouser\n- NoteBlockMatt\n- KaiCoyote\n- MrMinerMan21\n- Tem4ik\n\n### Play Tester(s)\n- Sebushtin Bush",
